OL,3,GNEWSAUkraine is worst it's ever been,
OL,4,Asays Hereford dad
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Hereford dad who has been in Ukraine
OL,7,Fdelivering vital aid has described the
OL,8,Fcountry as "more dangerous than ever" -
OL,9,Fafter leaving the country for his own
OL,10,Fsafety.
OL,12,FPete Masters, 59, has described his
OL,13,Fharrowing experience sheltering in
OL,14,Fchurches during heavy Russian attacks
OL,15,Fthrough the night.
OL,17,FThe dad-of-four has been in north-east
OL,18,FUkraine, in the city of Sloviansk, for
OL,19,Fthe past two months delivering winter
OL,20,Fclothes, food and other aid to
OL,21,Fsoldiers.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
